  "description": "Sensitively refurbish, reconfigure and extend this Grade II listed dwelling to provide a high-quality family home whilst preserving its special\r\narchitectural and historic interest. The works include the reorganisation of the lower ground floor, a modest rear extension, rationalisation and extension of the existing later rear projection, relocation of bathroom accommodation, improvements to the front lightwell,\r\nand the repair and restoration of historic fabric. The scheme adopts a conservation-led approach, focusing change within later additions and areas of lower heritage significance whilst preserving the principal ground floor rooms, original architectural features and\r\nhistoric character of the building.\r\nWritten advice with site visit\t£1,200\t£240\t£1,440",
